c Lu\'cbt s\'f6a \'ae\'e6i, b\'e6 sung m\'e9t s\'e8 \'aei\'d2u c\'f1a Lu\'cbt thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u;
\par B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n th\'f9c hi\'d6n v\'d2 thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u nh\'ad sau:
