\par - Tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep c\'e3 s\'f9 gian l\'cbn, tr\'e8n thu\'d5 th\'d7 ph\'b6i truy thu ti\'d2n thu\'d5, ti\'d2n ph\'b9t trong th\'eai h\'b9n 5 (n\'a8m) n\'a8m tr\'eb v\'d2 tr\'ad\'edc k\'d3 t\'f5 ng\'b5y ki\'d3m tra ph\'b8t hi\'d6n c\'e3 s\'f9 gian l\'cb
n, tr\'e8n thu\'d5. Gian l\'cbn, tr\'e8n thu\'d5 g\'e5m t\'cat c\'b6 c\'b8c tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep \'ae\'d2u ph\'b6i truy thu thu\'d5 ngo\'b5i hai tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep ph\'b6i truy thu n\'aau tr\'aan.
\par 2/ C\'a8n c\'f8 \'ae\'d3 t\'ddnh truy thu xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u l\'b5 gi\'b8 t\'ddnh thu\'d5 v\'b5 thu\'d5 su\'cat \'ae\'ad\'eec \'b8p d\'f4ng theo quy \'ae\'denh t\'b9i th\'eai \'aei\'d3m t\'ddnh truy thu thu\'d5.
\par 3/ Th\'eai h\'b9n k\'aa khai truy n\'e9p thu\'d5 l\'b5 2 (hai) ng\'b5y k\'d3 t\'f5 ng\'b5y thay \'ae\'e6i m\'f4c \'ae\'ddch s\'f6 d\'f4ng ghi tr\'aan c\'b8c v\'a8n b\'b6n, ch\'f8ng t\'f5, ho\'b8 \'ae\'acn c\'e3 li\'aan quan. Tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep kh\'abng c
