\par }\pard \qj\fi567\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright {Theo quy \'ae\'denh t\'b9i Lu\'cbt thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u; c\'b8c Lu\'cbt s\'f6a \'ae\'e6i, b\'e6 sung m\'e9t s\'e8 \'aei\'d2u c\'f1a L\'f4\'a9t thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8
u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u v\'b5 Ngh\'de \'ae\'denh s\'e8 94/1998/N\'a7-CP ng\'b5y 17/11/1998 c\'f1a Ch\'ddnh ph\'f1, \'ae\'e8i t\'ad\'eeng n\'e9p thu\'d5, c\'b8n b\'e9 thu\'d5 v\'b5 c\'b8 nh\'a9n kh\'b8c vi ph\'b9m Lu\'cbt thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu
\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u b\'de x\'f6 l\'fd nh\'ad sau:
\par 1/ \'a7\'e8i v\'edi \'ae\'e8i t\'ad\'eeng n\'e9p thu\'d5:
\par a/ Kh\'abng th\'f9c hi\'d6n, ho\'c6c th\'f9c hi\'d6n kh\'abng \'ae\'f3ng nh\'f7ng quy \'ae\'denh v\'d2 th\'f1 t\'f4c \'ae\'a8ng k\'fd, k\'aa khai h\'b5ng h\'e3a xu\'cat nh\'cbp kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u, ch\'f8ng t\'f5 li\'aan quan \'ae\'d5n vi\'d6
c t\'ddnh thu\'d5, n\'e9p thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u th\'d7 tu\'fa theo t\'ddnh ch\'cat, m\'f8c \'ae\'e9 vi ph\'b9m nh\'d1 ho\'c6c n\'c6ng m\'b5 b\'de c\'b6nh c\'b8o ho\'c6c ph\'b9t ti\'d2n v\'d2 vi ph\'b9m h\'b5nh ch\'ddnh v\'d2 thu
\'d5.
\par b/ N\'e9p ch\'cbm ti\'d2n thu\'d5 ho\'c6c ti\'d2n ph\'b9t so v\'edi s\'e8 ng\'b5y quy \'ae\'denh ph\'b6i n\'e9p ghi trong th\'abng b\'b8o thu\'d5, quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh truy thu ho\'c6c quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh x\'f6 l\'fd v\'d2 thu\'d5 th\'d7 ngo\'b5i vi\'d6
c ph\'b6i n\'e9p \'ae\'f1 s\'e8 ti\'d2n thu\'d5, ti\'d2n ph\'b9t theo Lu\'cbt \'ae\'denh, m\'e7i ng\'b5y n\'e9p ch\'cbm c\'dfn ph\'b6i n\'e9p ph\'b9t b\'bbng 0,1% (m\'e9t ph\'c7n ngh\'d7n) s\'e8 ti\'d2n ch\'cbm n\'e9p.
\par c/ Khai man thu\'d5, tr\'e8n thu\'d5 th\'d7 ngo\'b5i vi\'d6c ph\'b6i n\'e9p \'ae\'f1 s\'e8 thu\'d5 theo quy \'ae\'denh c\'f1a Lu\'cbt thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u, t\'efy theo t\'ddnh ch\'cat, m\'f8c \'ae\'e9 vi ph\'b9m c\'dfn b\'de ph
\'b9t ti\'d2n t\'f5 1 \'ae\'d5n 5 l\'c7n s\'e8 thu\'d5 gian l\'cbn. C\'f4 th\'d3 nh\'ad m\'e9t s\'e8 c\'b8c tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep:
