\par - Khai b\'b8o sai h\'b5ng h\'e3a xu\'cat kh\'c8u, nh\'cbp kh\'c8u so v\'edi th\'f9c t\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, nh\'cbp kh\'c8u nh\'ad sai t\'aan h\'b5ng, gi\'b8, s\'e8 l\'ad\'eeng, ch\'f1ng lo\'b9i, ph\'c8m c\'cap, ch\'cat l\'ad\'eeng, xu\'cat x\'f8 h\'b5
ng...;
\par - L\'cbp h\'e5 s\'ac ch\'f8ng t\'f5 mua b\'b8n gi\'b6, cung c\'cap kh\'abng \'ae\'c7y \'ae\'f1, sai l\'d6ch h\'e5 s\'ac c\'e3 li\'aan quan \'ae\'d5n vi\'d6c t\'ddnh thu\'d5 cho c\'ac quan H\'b6i quan;
\par - Khai b\'b8o sai m\'f4c \'ae\'ddch, th\'f9c tr\'b9ng h\'b5ng h\'e3a \'ae\'d3 \'ae\'ad\'eec mi\'d4n gi\'b6m thu\'d5; ho\'b5n thu\'d5;
\par - S\'f6 d\'f4ng h\'b5ng h\'e3a \'ae\'ad\'eec mi\'d4n thu\'d5, gi\'b6m thu\'d5 kh\'b8c v\'edi m\'f4c \'ae\'ddch \'ae\'b7 \'ae\'ad\'eec mi\'d4n, gi\'b6m thu\'d5 nh\'adng c\'e8 t\'d7nh kh\'abng khai b\'b8o \'ae\'d3 k\'aa khai truy n\'e9p thu\'d5, b\'b8n h
\'b5ng mi\'d4n thu\'d5 sai \'ae\'e8i t\'ad\'eeng, \'ae\'ada h\'b5ng b\'b8n mi\'d4n thu\'d5 v\'b5o th\'de tr\'ad\'eang Vi\'d6t Nam khi ch\'ada \'ae\'ad\'eec ph\'d0p v.v...
\par Tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep tr\'e8n thu\'d5 v\'edi s\'e8 l\'ad\'eeng l\'edn ho\'c6c \'ae\'b7 b\'de x\'f6 vi ph\'b9t ph\'b9m h\'b5nh ch\'ddnh v\'d2 thu\'d5 m\'b5 c\'dfn ti\'d5p t\'f4c vi ph\'b9m ho\'c6c c\'e3 h\'b5nh vi vi ph\'b9m nghi\'aam tr\'e4ng kh\'b8c th\'d7
 b\'de truy c\'f8u tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m h\'d7nh s\'f9 theo quy \'ae\'denh c\'f1a Ph\'b8p lu\'cbt.
\par d/ Kh\'abng n\'e9p thu\'d5, n\'e9p ph\'b9t theo quy\'d5t \'ae\'denh x\'f6 l\'fd v\'d2 thu\'d5 th\'d7 b\'de c\'ad\'ecng ch\'d5 thi h\'b5nh b\'bbng c\'b8c bi\'d6n ph\'b8p sau:
\par - Tr\'ddch ti\'d2n g\'f6i c\'f1a \'ae\'e8i t\'ad\'eeng n\'e9p thu\'d5 t\'b9i Ng\'a9n h\'b5ng, t\'e6 ch\'f8c t\'ddn d\'f4ng kh\'b8c, kho b\'b9c \'ae\'d3 n\'e9p thu\'d5, n\'e9p ph\'b9t.
