\'fd vi ph\'b9m v\'d2 thu\'d5.
\par 2/ \'a7\'e8i v\'edi c\'b8n b\'e9 thu\'d5 v\'b5 c\'b8 nh\'a9n kh\'b8c vi ph\'b9m Lu\'cbt thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u s\'cf b\'de x\'f6 l\'fd theo quy \'ae\'denh t\'b9i \'a7i\'d2u 22 Lu\'cbt thu\'d5 xu\'cat kh\'c8u, thu\'d5 nh\'cbp kh
